# textdomain: doggiowars
# Croatian translation of DoggioWars. English is the source language.

Aerial dogfight over floating voxel islands — you ARE the fighter plane. 12 island biomes, volcanoes and waterfalls, aerobatic tricks, destructible terrain and greyhound races after a golden rabbit. Keyboard + gamepad.=Zračna borba iznad lebdećih voksel otoka — TI SI lovac. 12 otočnih bioma, vulkani i slapovi, akrobatski manevri, uništivi teren i utrke hrtova za zlatnim zecom. Tipkovnica + gamepad.
